OL,3,GNEWSASailor with severe head injury
OL,4,Aafter ship fall rescued
OL,5,
OL,6,FA crew member who fell from height
OL,7,Fwithin the generator room of a ship and
OL,8,Fsuffered a "severe head injury" has
OL,9,Fbeen rescued.
OL,11,FFollowing a Mayday call, the Gravesend
OL,12,FRNLI Lifeboat was sent to a large work
OL,13,Fship docked at London Gateway Port in
OL,14,FThurrock, Essex, at 19:40 BST on
OL,15,FTuesday.
OL,17,FMembers of the lifeboat crew had to
OL,18,Fnavigate "confined spaces, tight
OL,19,Fbulkheads and steep stairways" within
OL,20,Fthe room to safely evacuate the crew
OL,21,Fmember.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
